      "message": "* **Missing FFF Global History Reset:**\nWhile you correctly reset the individual fakes using `RESET_FAKE(...)` in `ft98xx_alg_before`, you are missing a call to reset the FFF global call history. If any future tests rely on the sequence of calls across multiple mocked functions, state will leak between tests.\n**Recommendation:** Add `FFF_RESET_HISTORY();` at the beginning of `ft98xx_alg_before`.",
